# kgit: where a workload is defined in the GitOps repo
Output docs/kgit.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1300
Set Height 520
Set Padding 18
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 80ms
Hide
Type "export PS1='demo $ ' && clear"
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Show
Hide
Type `cd "$DEMO_FLEET" && clear`
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Show
Type "kgit"
Enter
Sleep 3s
Type "api/api"
Sleep 1200ms
Enter
Sleep 4s
Escape
Sleep 1s
